continue to believe, or whatever your one word is,

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:29.820
and I'll see you soon.

00:20:35.860 --> 00:20:39.700
And a lot that is required to truly perceive things,

00:20:39.700 --> 00:20:44.660
and immediately things become more alive and less problematic

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:50.100
when you go into sense perception, because the problematic dimension is in the head,

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:51.860
and you go into sense perception,

00:20:51.860 --> 00:20:55.980
suddenly you [?] into the present moment, and in the present moment,

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:59.180
problems disappear.

00:20:59.180 --> 00:21:00.860
Isn't that strange?

00:21:00.860 --> 00:21:03.640
So the mind says, "Well, I still 𝘩𝘢𝘷𝘦 them."

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:08.800
Yeah, when you start thinking about them, you have them again.

00:21:08.800 --> 00:21:10.860
But when you're not thinking about them,

00:21:10.860 --> 00:21:12.560
you have no problems.

00:21:12.560 --> 00:21:17.020
Now some of you will argue with that, but let me explain.

00:21:18.560 --> 00:21:22.440
You have situations in your life that can be challenging

00:21:22.440 --> 00:21:25.420
and you have to deal with these situations,

00:21:25.420 --> 00:21:28.420
but the only place where you can deal with the challenging situations

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:30.360
is in the present moment.

00:21:31.460 --> 00:21:35.900
And dealing with a challenging situation in the present moment is not a problem.

00:21:35.900 --> 00:21:40.080
You're dealing with a challenging situation. You're facing it, you're looking at it,

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:44.660
and that looking is important. What I call "looking" really is

00:21:44.660 --> 00:21:48.580
putting your attention on it, which is the power of consciousness.

00:21:48.580 --> 00:21:50.900
And while you're looking, you're not thinking.

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:57.280
Every person who has achieved mastery in any field

00:21:57.280 --> 00:22:00.580
knows what I mean by looking,

00:22:00.580 --> 00:22:03.360
because there's an absolute presence,

00:22:03.360 --> 00:22:07.360
and then that person does what he or she does.

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:11.140
It flows from that presence.

00:22:11.140 --> 00:22:14.320
So you look- there's no problem.

00:22:14.320 --> 00:22:18.220
Problem is when you dwell mentally on something that will happen,

00:22:18.220 --> 00:22:20.200
could happen, might happen;

00:22:20.200 --> 00:22:24.680
a problem that something I have to face next week but not now,

00:22:24.700 --> 00:22:28.160
and you're totally absorbed in that. That's problem.

00:22:28.160 --> 00:22:33.400
An interesting thing- I may have even written that in The Power of Now,

00:22:33.400 --> 00:22:36.460
if you think you have problems, ask yourself,

00:22:36.460 --> 00:22:39.760
"What problem do I have at this moment?"

00:22:39.760 --> 00:22:42.420
But this moment really means this moment.

00:22:43.380 --> 00:22:45.540
And then you have to go, "Hmm..."

00:22:46.340 --> 00:22:50.840
"Well, I've got my wife, my ex-wife is suing me,

00:22:50.840 --> 00:22:53.380
I'm about to lose my home...

00:22:57.360 --> 00:22:59.500
a person close to me is ill,

00:22:59.500 --> 00:23:01.480
I might lose my job,

00:23:02.100 --> 00:23:04.520
I have to look for a new job."

00:23:04.520 --> 00:23:07.780
Okay, what problem do you have at 𝘵𝘩𝘪𝘴 moment?

00:23:11.980 --> 00:23:16.660
You're breathing, feeling the aliveness in the body, looking around.

00:23:16.660 --> 00:23:21.540
"Well at this moment, I don't actually have a problem."

00:23:21.540 --> 00:23:26.140
You have to then admit, if you really go into the present moment,

00:23:26.140 --> 00:23:30.420
the problem cannot survive in the present moment. (chuckles)

00:23:30.420 --> 00:23:32.160
It's an amazing realization.

00:23:32.160 --> 00:23:36.160
It doesn't mean that you no longer deal with what you need to deal with.

00:23:36.160 --> 00:23:39.840
You deal with it when the moment comes more effectively

00:23:39.840 --> 00:23:43.660
when you don't waste your life energy

00:23:43.660 --> 00:23:49.060
in the mental realm of creating problems that cannot be dealt with at this moment.

00:23:49.060 --> 00:23:52.480
If you wake up in the middle of the night thinking about your problems

00:23:52.480 --> 00:23:54.320
and what you can do about them,

00:23:54.320 --> 00:23:58.520
It's extremely unlikely that you find any solution by worrying

00:23:58.520 --> 00:24:02.240
at 4 o'clock in the morning about it.

00:24:02.240 --> 00:24:04.600
But if you became still at 4 o'clock in the morning,

00:24:04.600 --> 00:24:07.340
and wake up and go into the inner energy field of the body

00:24:07.340 --> 00:24:10.180
rather than thinking about your problems, in other words;

00:24:10.180 --> 00:24:12.700
leave the dimension of problems,

00:24:12.700 --> 00:24:16.000
come deeply into the present moment,

00:24:16.000 --> 00:24:19.060
then perhaps the next morning when you wake up,

00:24:19.060 --> 00:24:22.540
you suddenly say, "Oh, I know what I have to do now.

00:24:22.540 --> 00:24:24.500
I know how I can deal with it now."

00:24:24.500 --> 00:24:26.600
And the right course of action happens,

00:24:26.600 --> 00:24:28.560
because you've gone 𝘵𝘩𝘦𝘳𝘦.

00:24:28.560 --> 00:24:32.420
But not through the problem-making faculty in the human mind.

00:24:33.440 --> 00:24:36.760
So again, coming back to your question,

00:24:36.760 --> 00:24:41.480
when things are- when you're not being challenged,

00:24:41.480 --> 00:24:42.920
practice it.

00:24:42.920 --> 00:24:46.380
And then when you 𝘢𝘳𝘦 being challenged by

00:24:46.380 --> 00:24:51.700
little thing that goes wrong, so to speak, in daily life

00:24:51.700 --> 00:24:54.520
tends to happen, you might have noticed.

00:24:54.520 --> 00:24:58.080
Things don't always go according to your expectations.

00:24:58.080 --> 00:25:01.120
Sometimes you miss the bus,

00:25:01.120 --> 00:25:05.440
or something- you miss the plane, or something else goes wrong,

00:25:05.440 --> 00:25:08.180
it tends to happen actually quite a lot.

00:25:08.180 --> 00:25:10.940
It seems to be part of life.

00:25:10.940 --> 00:25:14.740
That's, by the way, it's the reason why people go to see movies.

00:25:15.200 --> 00:25:19.100
Because the substructure of every movie that you see,

00:25:19.100 --> 00:25:21.280
we could call it--

00:25:21.280 --> 00:25:24.400
it applies to virtually every movie you see, if you can--

00:25:24.420 --> 00:25:26.360
I mean any movie you see,

00:25:26.360 --> 00:25:28.440
what actually happens in the movie.

00:25:28.440 --> 00:25:33.040
I can describe every movie to you in three words:

00:25:33.040 --> 00:25:34.800
Something goes wrong.

00:25:34.800 --> 00:25:38.800
(audience laughter)

00:25:38.800 --> 00:25:41.960
Because there wouldn't be a movie otherwise! Nothing would happen.

00:25:41.960 --> 00:25:46.840
Nobody would evolve. Everything would be dead.

00:25:46.840 --> 00:25:49.280
But in your own life, you complain.

00:25:49.280 --> 00:25:52.160
So you see movies to see something go wrong,

00:25:52.160 --> 00:25:54.360
but when it happens in your own life, you complain.

00:25:54.360 --> 00:25:57.180
Not you personally. You've transcended it perhaps already.

00:25:57.180 --> 00:25:59.520
(audience laughter)

00:25:59.520 --> 00:26:02.720
But so the strange thing is,

00:26:02.720 --> 00:26:06.540
things are not meant 𝘯𝘰𝘵 to go wrong.

00:26:06.540 --> 00:26:12.280
Going wrong is part of the totality of how life experiences itself.

00:26:12.280 --> 00:26:15.120
If things didn't go wrong,

00:26:15.120 --> 00:26:18.700
they would be very uninteresting and nobody would evolve.

00:26:18.700 --> 00:26:23.300
Because people only evolve through the challenges that they encounter,

00:26:23.300 --> 00:26:28.780
and in a good movie, the protagonist or the character

00:26:28.780 --> 00:26:34.060
changes as he or she faces that which goes wrong in the movie.

00:26:34.060 --> 00:26:37.000
In a bad movie, so to speak,

00:26:37.000 --> 00:26:39.860
the character does not go through any changes.

00:26:39.860 --> 00:26:43.440
That which goes wrong is only solved on an external level.

00:26:43.440 --> 00:26:46.120
In the end the bad guy is killed,

00:26:46.120 --> 00:26:49.040
and that's the end of the movie, but nothing else happens.

00:26:49.040 --> 00:26:50.420
(chuckles) So

00:26:51.340 --> 00:26:56.500
Something going wrong is part of how life experiences itself

00:26:56.500 --> 00:27:01.700
and again, you can then bring awareness to that

00:27:01.700 --> 00:27:08.740
so that you don't always fall into reactivity when something goes wrong.

00:27:08.740 --> 00:27:11.600
But you immediately align with it.

